() Tj T*
(FIRST WEEK CHECKLIST) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(New employees should complete their I-9 and tax withholding forms through the HR portal) Tj T*
(before their first day. IT will provision a laptop and company accounts once the signed) Tj T*
(offer letter is received; equipment is typically ready for pickup at the front desk by 9) Tj T*
(a.m. on the start date.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Every new hire is paired with an onboarding buddy from their team for the first thirty) Tj T*
(days. The buddy is responsible for introducing the new hire to the team, scheduling an) Tj T*
(informal welcome lunch within the first week, and answering day-to-day questions so) Tj T*
(managers aren't the only point of contact.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(All new employees must complete the mandatory workplace safety and code-of-conduct) Tj T*
(training modules within the first five business days. Access to internal engineering) Tj T*
(systems is automatically suspended for anyone who has not completed training within two) Tj T*
(weeks of their start date.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(BENEFITS OVERVIEW) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Health, dental, and vision coverage begins on the first day of the month following thirty) Tj T*
(days of employment. Enrollment elections must be submitted within that thirty-day window;) Tj T*
(missing the window means waiting until the next annual open enrollment period in November.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Full-time employees accrue fifteen days of paid time off per year during their first three) Tj T*
(years, increasing to twenty days starting in year four. Unused PTO up to five days may be) Tj T*
(carried over into the following calendar year; any amount beyond that is forfeited.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The 401\(k\) plan matches fifty cents on the dollar up to six percent of salary, with) Tj T*
(employer contributions vesting fully after two years of continuous employment. Employees) Tj T*
(become eligible to enroll in the plan on the first payroll cycle after their start date.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(IT AND SECURITY POLICIES) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Company laptops must have disk encryption and the endpoint security agent active at all) Tj T*
(times; IT runs an automated compliance check every Monday morning and will remotely lock) Tj T*
(any device found out of compliance. Employees working from a personal device must use the) Tj T*
(company VPN for any access to internal systems.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Multi-factor authentication is required for all company accounts, including email, source) Tj T*
(control, and the HR portal. Lost or stolen devices must be reported to the IT security) Tj T*
ET
